RedHatText-Regular.ttf and RedHatText-Bold.ttf are static instances from the
Red Hat font project (https://github.com/RedHatOfficial/RedHatFont), used here
to render the build-time social share cards (generate/share-card.ts) via
satori — the same family the blog self-hosts for readers (client/fonts/), so
the cards carry the blog's type identity.

Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 — full text in OFL.txt beside
this file.
